WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.960
Most people use AI like a slot machine.

00:01.960 --> 00:05.080
They type a prompt, pull the lever, and hope the answer is useful.

00:05.080 --> 00:06.960
That is not a system. That is a moment.

00:06.960 --> 00:08.360
A prompt gives you output.

00:08.360 --> 00:10.320
An operating system gives you continuity.

00:10.320 --> 00:15.760
It remembers context. It uses tools. It follows skills. It routes work.

00:15.760 --> 00:18.560
It creates the next action instead of dumping more text in your lap.

00:18.560 --> 00:20.560
That is the real transition happening right now.

00:20.560 --> 00:25.360
We are moving from asking AI questions to building structures AI can operate inside.

00:25.360 --> 00:27.760
And once that happens, the leverage is no longer theoretical.

00:27.760 --> 00:32.360
One person can run faster, respond faster, and ship more without adding headcount.

00:32.360 --> 00:35.000
That is the game: not better prompts, better systems.
